    narr:narration """The trajectory of the [core decision capture feature](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has evolved from a March 2026 product thesis into a series of concrete operational milestones. The product identity remains centered on the [capture of decision artifacts](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) at the moment of consensus. By July 2026, this conceptual framework transitioned into tangible delivery, marked by the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784801427646_1). This execution phase is attributed to a [technical unlock via the Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784801427646_3), which coincides with a [peak in team velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784801427646_2) for the quarter. The narrative currently tracks the shift from foundational differentiation to realized product capability.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784801427646_1> ;
